  "ruleText": "Nat 301.02 “American College of Naturopathic Obstetricians (ACNO)” means a national professional organization which sponsors an examination for certification of naturopathic obstetricians.\n\nSource. #6380, eff 11-26-96, EXPIRED: 11-26-04\n\nNew. #8374, eff 6-18-05, EXPIRED: 6-18-13\n\nNew. #12176, eff 5-17-17",
